<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">

<head>
    <title>Despre Aegis Dynamics | Istoric si Misiune</title>
    <%- include("../fragmente/head") %>
</head>

<body id="top">
    <%- include("../fragmente/header") %>

    <!-- e5 efect-css-reflexie-text: heading cu reflexie (::after scaleY(-1) + blur), alungire la hover -->
    <div class="reflexie-container">
        <span class="reflexie-text" data-text="AEGIS">AEGIS</span>
    </div>

    <main class="layout-grid layout-despre">
        <section>
            <h2>Istoria Noastra</h2>
            <p>Aegis Dynamics a fost fondata in 2020 cu misiunea de a revolutiona industria de aparare prin inovatie tehnologica si transparenta in contractele B2G.</p>
            <p>De-a lungul anilor, am devenit parteneri de incredere pentru numeroase guverne, oferind solutii avansate de securitate nationala.</p>
        </section>
        
        <section>
            <h2>Misiune si Valori</h2>
            <p>Ne dedicam protejarii valorilor democratice si asigurarii pacii prin superioritate tehnologica. Integritatea, inovatia si excelenta sunt pilonii pe care ne construim viitorul.</p>
            <img src="/resurse/imagini/f35_medium.jpg" alt="Aegis Misiune" style="max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px;">
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- e5 efect-css-stilizare-hr + e5 efect-css-duotone + e5 bootstrap-custom element demonstrativ -->
    <section class="showcase">
        <!-- e5 efect-css-stilizare-hr: linie + stelute ::before/::after din schema cromatica -->
        <hr class="hr-stelute">

        <div class="showcase-rand">
            <!-- e5 efect-css-duotone: div cu background-image + mix-blend-mode, hover -> grayscale -->
            <div class="duotone" role="img" aria-label="Imagine duotone aeronava"></div>

            <!-- e5 bootstrap-custom: card + buton Bootstrap cu variabilele customizate -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Buletin de presa</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Componenta Bootstrap customizata cu schema cromatica Aegis
                        (raze de border, font Rajdhani, culori proprii).</p>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Citeste mai mult</button>
                    <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">Nou</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("../fragmente/footer") %>
</body>

</html>
